1
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:09,720
What is it?

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,720
Is there anyone coming at this time?

3
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,850
- Who are you?

4
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:21,900
Yumi unnie!

5
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,540
Yumi

6
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:46,460
Please make me a glass of honey water when I wake up tomorrow

7
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,960
Warmly

8
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,220
Yes

9
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:52,590
But who?

10
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:55,850
Oh, I'm late to introduce myself

11
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,640
I am Yumi's boss

12
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,310
My name is Yoo Ji-min

13
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,310
Ah, yes

14
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:04,940
What about you?

15
00:01:06,020 --> 00:01:07,650
Oh, I am

16
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,740
Oh, no

17
00:01:10,030 --> 00:01:10,990
It's done

18
00:01:18,830 --> 00:01:20,540
Feels familiar

19
00:01:20,790 --> 00:01:21,710
This picture

20
00:01:25,290 --> 00:01:26,250
Ah, and

21
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,920
I was also an ex-lover

22
00:01:32,590 --> 00:01:34,300
What

23
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:37,100
It might change now, but

24
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,640
What?

25
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:42,640
No, I just thought

26
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,140
it wouldn't be bad to know

27
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:47,730
Then take care

28
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:00,700
Are you okay?

29
00:02:02,790 --> 00:02:04,120
It's Ga-eun

30
00:02:09,090 --> 00:02:10,590
Gaeun

31
00:02:11,170 --> 00:02:12,590
I'm sorry

32
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:33,740
You were surprised when I suddenly called you out, right?

33
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:37,950
Oh, yes

34
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:41,120
I thought you called because of Yumi unnie's work

35
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:44,540
You called me to talk about Yumi, right?

36
00:02:46,170 --> 00:02:47,170
Me

37
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,670
I used to live with Yumi

38
00:02:52,550 --> 00:02:53,880
Together?

39
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:56,930
I lived together with you

40
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,390
Like Yumi and Ga-eun

41
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,520
It really fit well

42
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,770
I left at an important moment

43
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,610
Without any explanation

44
00:03:13,110 --> 00:03:14,110
So Yumi

45
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:17,110
You still hate me, don't you?

46
00:03:21,620 --> 00:03:22,950
But it's understandable

47
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,710
Because you left without any explanation

48
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,750
At that time

49
00:03:29,380 --> 00:03:31,380
I was a bit scared

50
00:03:38,130 --> 00:03:39,840
But it's different now

51
00:03:41,930 --> 00:03:42,720
And

52
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,970
I know how sincere Yumi is about her work

53
00:03:47,770 --> 00:03:50,060
How long I've endured for a promotion

54
00:03:52,730 --> 00:03:53,520
Yumi

55
00:03:54,110 --> 00:03:55,360
She is a candidate for promotion

56
00:03:57,690 --> 00:03:58,660
Really?

57
00:03:59,490 --> 00:04:01,030
It's almost certain

58
00:04:02,410 --> 00:04:03,620
However,

59
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:07,870
The final decision-making authority is

60
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:09,540
I have it

61
00:04:14,250 --> 00:04:16,460
What does that have to do with me?

62
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:21,300
When personal relationships become entangled

63
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,180
It gets sensitive up there

64
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:29,310
Especially in a relationship like this right now

65
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:44,240
House

66
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,160
I'll look into it for you

67
00:04:47,250 --> 00:04:49,710
Including the deposit and moving costs

68
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,130
This is not a deal

69
00:04:54,250 --> 00:04:55,920
It's a choice for Yumi

70
00:04:57,210 --> 00:04:59,210
If you don't want to ruin his life

71
00:05:03,340 --> 00:05:05,810
Are you asking me to accept this?

72
00:05:06,890 --> 00:05:08,430
If you think of Yumi

73
00:05:08,890 --> 00:05:11,060
This is the most realistic choice

74
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,150
With just love

75
00:05:15,150 --> 00:05:17,150
I can't protect everything

76
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:12,000
My life is my own decision

77
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:16,330
That was a confession

78
00:06:17,330 --> 00:06:18,920
The company is like that too

79
00:06:19,590 --> 00:06:20,920
That person, Jimin, is like that too
